  "description": "Server→client notifications / toasts for SetNet: server.UseNotifications() pushes a typed Notification to one player or broadcasts to all; client.UseNotifications() raises Received. Undelivered notifications for offline players are queued in a pluggable INotificationStore and flushed on their next connect. Rides the unified protocol. Depends only on SetNet.",
